Weather forecast and rain radar data
  Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), https://opendata.dwd.de
  MOSMIX forecasts and RADOLAN radar composites are fetched at run time and are
  not stored in this repository. DWD's open data may be used provided the
  source is named ("Deutscher Wetterdienst").

DWD station list (web/public/dwd-stations.json)
  Built from DWD's MOSMIX station catalogue and forecast listing by
  scripts/build-dwd-stations.mjs. Source: Deutscher Wetterdienst.

Base map (web/public/radar-map.json)
  Made with Natural Earth, 1:10m, by scripts/build-radar-map.mjs.
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com. Public domain.

Other fonts and npm packages are installed from the registry at build time
